      "id": 406605,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "When you changed your account's name, profile picture, etc. while you had a Twitter Blue subscription, your verification badge would temporarily disappear from your profile and your profile would be sent to the Twitter team for review. If you perform this action a day before your Twitter Blue subscription expires and cancel it, the verified badge will return to your profile after your account's edited information checked by Twitter team.\n\nIn this way, you can have the verified badge forever without paying any money.\n",
